    "text": "Let <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msubsup><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></mfenced><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>&#8734;</mo></msubsup></math> be a sequence such that <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub></math> for all <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>n</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn></math>.&nbsp;Then the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>47</mn><munderover><mo>&#8721;</mo><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo>&#8734;</mo></munderover><mfenced><mfrac><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>n</mi></msub><msup><mn>2</mn><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>n</mi></mrow></msup></mfrac></mfenced></math> is equal to ________."
